        </div>
        <div class="activity-body">
          <div class="phrase-box">
            <div class="phrase-label">Present Simple vs Present Continuous</div>
            <div class="phrase-row">
              <span class="phrase-en">Present Simple</span>
              <span class="phrase-de">Facts, habits, routines, things always true → <em>I work in digital marketing. She manages a team.</em></span>
            </div>
            <div class="phrase-row">
              <span class="phrase-en">Present Continuous</span>
              <span class="phrase-de">Happening now, temporary situations → <em>I'm currently building a new app. We're expanding to the US.</em></span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="teacher-says">
            <div class="label">Пояснення для учня</div>
            <p><strong>Present Simple</strong> — те, що завжди правда або відбувається регулярно: <em>"I work as a marketer."</em></p>
            <p style="margin-top:6px;"><strong>Present Continuous</strong> — те, що відбувається зараз або тимчасово: <em>"I'm currently working on a campaign for the US market."</em></p>
            <p style="margin-top:6px;">⚠️ Деякі дієслова НЕ вживаються в Continuous (stative verbs): <em>know, understand, own, want, like, need, believe</em>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
