            <li>We usually (discuss) these issues over Skype every Thursday morning.<br>
              a) <strong>discuss</strong> &nbsp; b) discusses &nbsp; c) is discussing &nbsp; d) are discussing</li>
            <li>Dwight (learn) another programming language in order to find a new job.<br>
              a) learn &nbsp; b) learns &nbsp; c) <strong>is learning</strong> &nbsp; d) are learning</li>
