              a) <strong>don't like</strong> &nbsp; b) doesn't like &nbsp; c) are not liking &nbsp; d) is not liking</li>
            <li>Does Charlie still fix these bugs?<br>
              a) Do Charlie still fix these bugs? &nbsp; b) <strong>Does Charlie still fix these bugs?</strong> &nbsp; c) Is Charlie still fixing these bugs? &nbsp; d) Are Charlie still fixing these bugs?</li>
          </ol>

          <button class="reveal-btn" onclick="toggleReveal('rev5')">show answers ▾</button>
